.TH SDL_EnumerationResult 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_EnumerationResult \- Possible results from an enumeration callback.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_filesystem.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef enum SDL_EnumerationResult
.BI "{
.BI "    SDL_ENUM_CONTINUE,   /**< Value that requests that enumeration continue. */
.BI "    SDL_ENUM_SUCCESS,    /**< Value that requests that enumeration stop, successfully. */
.BI "    SDL_ENUM_FAILURE     /**< Value that requests that enumeration stop, as a failure. */
.BI "} SDL_EnumerationResult;
.fi
.SH AVAILABILITY
This enum is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_EnumerateDirectoryCallback (3type)
